          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitor Menaem wero Kad, kïpayta Israel könyi 39 nyo pö paytaghpa Asaria pöytoghinto Yuda, kïpayta ompö Samaria könyis taman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigh nyinte ngokï ompö tawu ECHOTYON le pöytoghin Yeropoam wero Nepat nyo kigh pipö Israel kwigh ngokï ntökuwonyö osiswechi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsetyï Pul, pöytoghinto Asirya, pipö Israel. Kïropchï Menaem nyinte kilen 34,000 cho pö silpa atökukil tïlyantanengwa atökïsïch owesyö paytaghtanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkwagha surï Menaem pipö Israel cho le sïkön. Kichikyï Menaem chi anka tïkwïl kïkonï ropïyen tömönut mut atökutö pöytoghinto Asirya. Kïmïla nyu pöytoghintonay korenyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
